  "label": "Gender Identity and Social Recognition",
  "description": "Transgender identity refers to a person's internal sense of their gender, which may differ from the sex they were assigned at birth. This identity is recognized and protected under human rights frameworks in many countries. The meme's use of derogatory language and stereotypes against transgender people is a form of hate speech that violates human rights and dignity.",
